factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 8 problems
  The reel_script says the 90 families worship at the temple for '5 generations' and the slide says 'ஐந்து தலைமுறைகள்'; the article supports this, so no issue there. However, the reel_script states the revenue department 'notice' was given for a commercial-use claim, which matches the article, so no issue there either.
  The caption says the temple committee petitioned 'வருவாய் துறை நோட்டீஸை எதிர்த்து' (against the revenue department notice); the article says they petitioned that the shed should not be removed, which is close, but the caption's claim that the shed is used 'by outstation devotees' is stated as the reason for the petition, which matches the article.
  The reel_script calls the fish-market complainant only 'நல்லூர்' (a village name) instead of the person's name 'நல்லூர் சண்முகசுந்தரம்', so the person is misidentified as a place name.
  The reel_script says the tenants are 'இலவச வீட்டுமனை பட்டா' applicants but omits the detail that the complaint was about the 25 persons specifically requesting this; this is present, so not an omission.
  The slide 'சம்பந்தப்பட்ட துறைக்கு அனுப்பி வைக்கப்பட்டது' attributes forwarding to all complaints, which is only stated for the collector's handling in general and is a reasonable reading, so this is not a clear error.
  The slides_spec 'கோவில் மனு' slide line 'தகரக் கொட்டகையை அகற்ற வேண்டாம் என மனு' is accurate, but the reel_script's phrase 'அதை அகற்றக்கூடாது என கோரினர்' is fine.
  The reel_script says 'மனுக்களை பெற்று' and the caption says 'மனுக்களை பெற்று' — both consistent with article.
  The caption date '2026-11-22' is the posting date and is excluded from checking.
